        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "feat(sessions): add local timezone prefix to archive filenames",
        "body": "## Summary\nAdd an optional local-date prefix (`YYYY-MM-DD_`) to archived session filenames when `agents.defaults.userTimezone` is configured, while keeping the UTC suffix for compatibility.\n\n## Review follow-up\n- QMD session-hit restoration now accepts prefixed archive stems, so prefixed `.md` exports still resolve back to the live session id.\n- Old UTC-only archive names remain supported, and users without a configured timezone keep the previous behavior.\n\n## Evidence\n- `pnpm exec vitest run src/config/sessions/artifacts.test.ts src/plugin-sdk/session-transcript-hit.test.ts`\n- `2` test files passed, `45` tests passed\n\nFixes #96611",
        "branch": "fix/session-archive-local-timezone",
